          %p the vertical maps here are due to various theorems by various people – except for the “physical quantization” on the left, that is used in physics but hasn’t been formalized
          %p
            the
            %strong horizontal maps are the conjecture we are after
            in the Stolz-Teichner program: The top horizontal map will involve making the notion of
            = succeed "EFT" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
